the premise of the movie is set in the  late king dynasty in china one day a  spoiled young man named wang is taking a  stroll in the market alongside his  minions they come across a beggar named  sukhan laying on the ground wang makes  his people assault the beggar for no  reason humiliating him and calling him  different names they bully the poor guy  but he doesn't bother to retaliate at  last wang pees on him asking him to  quench his thirst after they leave  sukhan is left behind in the street  senseless and beaten he has been living  in misery for the past month but life  was different for him before that the  scene cuts to a few months ago on the  same street wang and his minions steal a  little girl's toy for fun but this time  they are stopped by sukan he is a formal  martial arts expert who is turned into a  beggar even though sukhan's lifestyle is  looked down upon he has gained  popularity because of the fighting  skills that he frequently showcases  because of this he has also gained the  title of the leader of beggars sukan  asks wang for money then proceeds to  beat up his minions eventually justice  is served and the little girl gets her  toy back everyone cheers for sukan  making him the center of attraction that  night something strange happens in the  emperor's residence a guard loses  control of himself and starts attacking  the higher officials his eyes turn milky  white and his nails elongate almost as  if an entity has possessed him the  soldiers try their best to stop him but  the man can hardly be touched the city's  councilman fuka yuhang watches the  incident while hiding and praying for  his life simultaneously the emperor  unaware of everything is sleeping in his  chamber he also has a nightmare of  someone with long nails beheading his  soldiers the emperor wakes up covered in  sweat from the dream and immediately  calls fuca to his chamber by now the  guard has returned to his normal form  and has no memory of what he did the  emperor is informed that the same thing  happened to many people in the city  rumors blame it on a highly contagious  virus but the emperor knows better to  solve the problem he has to worship  heaven for days without meeting anyone  from outside hence he asks fuka to start  an investigation and find the root of  the problem while he is away fuca is  confused about where he should start the  investigation hence he asks his nephew  su can for help sukhan's wife fei-fei is  the woman of the house her orders are  absolute that no one can go against so  when she asks her husband to help fuca  sukan has to agree at the same time we  see a councilman frantically praying in  his house he has been getting nightmares  recently and has an eerie feeling in his  heart suddenly an invisible force knocks  over his bookshelf the man has locked  every door and window in the house with  chains and locks still he is paranoid  that someone has gotten inside his fear  comes to life when he hears someone  whispering behind him is a grim  reaper-like man waiting to end his life  suddenly the councilman is transported  to a dream world where all his  colleagues are killed and mounted on  poles he tries running away but his  limbs are caught and trapped in the end  they are torn apart and the man is  killed in a brutal murder the next day  sukan brings fuka to a brothel with an  excuse to investigate in reality he is  fed up with his wife and wants to have  fun with someone else for the night he  lines up a bunch of beautiful women and  is making his pick when he hears feife  calling him sukan caught in 4k quickly  makes an exit and pretends to be  entering the brothel for the first time  fei-fei knows that it is only an excuse  hence when they get back home she brings  out a whip looking to teach him a lesson  in bed the following morning sukan is  informed about another person being  possessed and killing guards he  immediately comes to their rescue and  once again impresses the people with his  fighting skills however in the middle of  the fight the rival gets an upper hand  and is about to land a fatal attack  right then enters shah ju the descendant  of feng jing religion he defeats the  rival with a single punch gaining  everyone's compliments he addresses  sukan as master and treats him with  respect but still sue can cannot help  but feel a hint of jealousy because of  shaju's popularity later that day sukan  is in the market when half of the crowd  stops abruptly they force an attack on  the other half revealing that they have  been possessed amidst the chaos sukhan  notices the grim reaper on top of a roof  he follows the man and ends up in a  field where he is attacked after a brief  struggle the reaper disappears on his  own back in the market feife is also  fighting the possessed but is about to  be killed then shaju arrives and defeats  every single possessed person he is  praised for saving many lives but the  family of the possessed are in distress  to help them shaju brings their  unconscious bodies to his home and  performs a ritual by the end of the  ritual they return to life and are all  better he also reveals that he has been  trained in white magic and knows a way  to stop the grim reaper sukan on the  other hand is furious that shaju is  getting all the attention to discredit  him he knocks his uncle out and blames  it on shaji's magic but it doesn't take  long before the trick is revealed and he  is humiliated in front of everyone at  midnight shaju comes to sukhan's house  to talk to him about something important  according to him the grim reaper is a  junior who used to learn magic with him  a long time ago he was the best student  the school ever had but was tricked into  failing the final test everyone in the  village apprehended him for cheating  which is why he has returned and is  seeking revenge on everyone fuca is  delighted that they finally have a lead  in the case however they will have to  make a plan to catch the culprit later  sukhan sees fei fei dying after falling  into the river when he goes to help her  he also drowns and ends up in a  hallucination he wakes up in the morning  and realizes he was just dreaming  however the dream was so vivid that he  suspects someone cast a spell on him  later that day wang is troubling people  as usual this time he takes it too far  and has to be stopped by shaju he  teaches the bullies a lesson and gains  appreciation from bystanders yet again  when it gets dark people gather in front  of a shrine to pray fuca pretends to be  sukan to lure the reaper in although he  is not so good at acting the plan works  and the reaper falls right into their  trap he tries to fight sukhan and kill  him but is in turn killed by shaju the  chaos subsides and the killings finally  end in the following scene everyone is  in front of the emperor telling him  about the progress impressed by shaji's  abilities he fails to recognize sukhan's  role in the mission sukan feels  humiliated when his presence isn't  acknowledged while shaji is asked to  stay longer in the palace once he is  alone with the emperor he is asked to  check his health using his magic shaju  predicts the nightmares are a symptom of  heart disease he assures the emperor  that he has a magical medicine that will  make him better in no time in only a few  weeks xiajiu and the emperor become  inseparable shaji's position in the  council rises and he becomes the general  of the palace his disciples also gain  extra respect in society people offer  them free food and services because of  their master then one night fuca calls  sukan outside for an important task but  as they talk he addresses sukhan as  master sue it turns out the person in  front of him is xiajiu wearing fuka's  face he discloses that he is the actual  grim reaper who has been controlling  everyone in the town with his magic for  the past few months  even though he is from a respected  family he was humiliated by the  villagers 10 years ago and has been  longing to take revenge ever since now  that he is just steps away from being  the emperor he has to kill sukan first  and seal the deal before sukhan can  comprehend anything shaju casts a spell  on him they are taken to an imaginary  world where xiaji is a giant he attacks  sukhan but the beggar takes advantage of  his size and narrowly makes an escape to  cast out of the spell sukan uses a  unique dragon technique and lands an  attack they return to the real world but  the battle continues sukhan is  physically stronger but in front of  shaji's spells he is left weakened  xiajjiu wants him to suffer so instead  of killing him he breaks his ankles and  curses him to live like an actual beggar  for the rest of his life at the same  time a troop sent by shaju attacks the  beggar base and kills everyone feife  fights for her life but eventually  suffers the same fate as the others in  the morning sue can returns and finds  out that everyone he ever loved has died  he holds feife and breaks into tears the  only person on his side is fuka who is  thankfully away when the place was  attacked enraged by the sight he goes to  the palace to ask for justice but even  the guards are on xiajiu's side and he  is no longer allowed inside cut to a  month after the incident shaji's curse  has fulfilled itself and sukan has  turned into a miserable beggar the  people who once used to look up to him  now refuse to come near him wang uses  the situation to teach sukhan a lesson  he and his minions take turns peeing on  the poor man still sukan doesn't fight  back and is numb to their insults when  he is at his lowest fuca finds him and  brings him back to his home he has also  lost his job and is in bad financial  condition he eats leftovers from  restaurants and brings the same for his  nephew eventually shaji's disciples  start showing their true faces they  demand free goods and assault everyone  who refuses to obey them people who were  on shajiyu's side before start dreading  his rule that night sukan drinks several  bottles of alcohol and decides to commit  the unthinkable he is about to jump off  a bridge when a stranger saves him it is  none other than his consciousness who  wants him to return to his normal self  and avenge his wife's death in the  morning sukan wakes up with renewed  motivation and a will to take revenge  meanwhile shajiyu's people go on a  rampage and to destroy businesses for  not offering them money a little girl  goes against them but they do not  hesitate to threaten her as well just  when she is about to get hurt sukan  arrives and beats everyone turning into  the town's hero again in the meantime  the emperor has gotten a hint of what  shaji is planning he also finds out the  medicine he is being fed is what causes  him intense nightmares however he is too  weak to fight against chajiu who has all  the palace guards on his side suddenly  sukhan arrives in the palace having  tricked all the guards and the security  system shaju asks everyone to stay away  wanting to defeat sukhan on his own an  intense battle follows where sukan  surprisingly overpowers shaju all the  pain and frustration he has gone through  in the past month comes flowing out of  him he gets a hold of shaji's throat and  is about to kill him but the magician  uses another spell to turn into fife  this sets sukan back a little but he  quickly recovers remembers all the times  that she whipped him and surprises him  with a counter-attack at last shaju is  thrown into the fire and killed shaji's  followers are agitated at their master's  death but before they can attack  sukhan's supporters arrive and fight  them in the last scene sukan is in the  streets continuing his life as a normal  beggar then one day he sees a girl who  looks exactly like fey fay the movie  ends as she offers him a piece of bread  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

